Z||000024||sloth85GT||08-12-2001||12:09 AM||||That sucks about the paint job, maybe you shoulda got the clear coat. And which Maaco did you get it done at? I'm not going to get mine done until the beginning of next year I figure. I don't see apoint in getting it done in like 2 months then making my car sit over the winter. But I got the new wheels. Check out my post. They're pretty damn sweet wheels. 15"x7" polished aluminum 5-star style ones with Dunlop GT/Qualifier 225/50R15 tires. Stock is 215s and I wanted to go a bit wider and I think 235 is max for a 7" rim, but I thought, naa, 225 is fine.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I already sold my stockers too. A guy at my moms work made me an offer, $25 a wheel so I said, sure, that's more than I expected to sell them for anyway. So that'll cover the stupid lug nuts that I have to order from Toysport (rice boy store on portage but the only place in Winnipeg that has my nuts).<P>I'm going to Vancouver to visit kinda, well that was the original plan, but it's mostly me and my girlfriend just wanting to get away for a week. It's gonna be soooooo nice to get away from Sport Chek for a whole week. Nuthin but R and R! (That's rest and relaxation if you didn't know  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> haha). <P>Oh and on a different topic, you seem to know a lot about cars, or alot more than me anyway. So you know how I had a blown exhaust gasket eh? Well anwyway.....ummmm 2 bolts broke off when I was undoing them. So it still sounds like shiat! Now, is my head screwed or can those bolts be drilled out? I have the new bolts already thanks to fierostore.com (althought they sent me the wrong ones first then they sent me the poper ones for free). So do you think that I can do that, if so, I know it'll cost a lot. Oh and I'm getting a wing too, did I tell you? Sqoach is sending me one. It has a small crack, but I think just body filler can fix that without any problems. All he wants is the shipping costs. What awesome people here!<P>Anyway, that's a long post I think I should stop.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.mts.net/~kuzma/fieronl.gif"> <BR>Dan<BR>1985 Silver GT||||reg||1
